## 0. Document Purpose

This document defines the implementation-grade design-token system for GrowFlow.

The purpose of Phase 06C is **not to redesign GrowFlow**. The visual direction was already established and frozen in the earlier design phases. This phase converts those decisions into a structured token architecture that frontend developers, component designers, Stitch prompts, and future page specifications can consume consistently.

The token system is the layer between:

```text
Brand Identity
    ↓
Visual Design Rules
    ↓
Design Tokens
    ↓
Core Components
    ↓
Application Shell
    ↓
Pages / Workflows
```

Every reusable visual property that should remain consistent across the product should be represented by a token or a documented component rule rather than independently invented on a page.

