# 2. Design Philosophy

GrowFlow uses the visual philosophy:

> **Soft Intelligence — Nothing screams; hierarchy still exists.**

The token system must preserve this principle.

Tokens should produce an interface that is:

- calm
- precise
- readable
- structured
- warm
- restrained
- sophisticated
- information-dense where appropriate
- visually expressive where storytelling is appropriate
- operationally clear
- accessible
- consistent across BUILD, SUPERVISE, and GOVERN

Tokens must not create:

- neon AI interfaces
- excessive gradients
- excessive shadows
- excessive rounded cards
- rainbow role themes
- overly decorative dashboards
- visually noisy status systems
- arbitrary per-page colors
- inconsistent typography
- excessive motion

