# 12. Typography System

Canonical font:

> **Manrope**

Required weights:

```text
400 Regular
500 Medium
600 SemiBold
700 Bold
800 ExtraBold
```

Recommended loading strategy:

- self-host or use an approved production font source
- preload only necessary weights
- avoid loading unused weights
- use `font-display: swap`
- preserve fallback stack

Canonical fallback:

```text
Manrope,
ui-sans-serif,
system-ui,
-apple-system,
BlinkMacSystemFont,
"Segoe UI",
sans-serif
```

