# 96. Final Freeze Statement

**Phase 06C — Frontend Design Tokens is the canonical token specification for GrowFlow's frontend design system.**

It formalizes the previously frozen Soft Intelligence visual direction into reusable primitives, semantic roles, component contracts, responsive rules, state semantics, motion rules, accessibility requirements, AI presentation rules, and implementation guidance.

The system is intentionally unified across:

```text
PUBLIC
BUILD
SUPERVISE
GOVERN
AI
DOCUMENTS
DASHBOARDS
WORKFLOWS
```

The token layer exists to ensure that future components and pages remain visually coherent without repeatedly redesigning the foundation.

The next phase may consume these tokens but must not silently redefine them.

**Phase 06C status: FROZEN / AUTHORITATIVE.**

